{
  "bodyHash": "5f27fc210505be31",
  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_7f09a54403d84afda84211f25088cd7c~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_1542,h_213,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_auto/new_default_plus_logo_new3_black_outline_x25.png\" alt=\"New Default+ Logo Banner 2024\" width=\"1125\" height=\"155\"></span><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">- 材质/资源包 -</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_47f2d72852b745b480548a428a67665f~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1519\" height=\"78\"></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">通过重命名物品来更改其纹理以自定义你的玩家，探索充满多样性的丰富新世界，并体验增强原版玩法的默认风格改动和新特性。</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_ab455951e8b24116b88fb44e341beeac~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider\" width=\"1519\" height=\"304\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">New Default+ 每月月底更新！始终为你当前的 Minecraft 版本下载最新的 New Default+ 更新以获得最佳体验！New Default+ 无需 OptiFine / Fabulously Optimized 即可使用，但许多特性需要它们的支持。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_47f2d72852b745b480548a428a67665f~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1519\" height=\"78\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_5c5faad466984afb8f90845403874bf2~mv2.png\" alt=\"v1.82 Spears &amp; Steeds\" width=\"1349\" height=\"759\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:36px\">New Default+ v1.82 “长矛与坐骑” 更新已发布！<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpowerups4u.wixsite.com%252fseaofpixels%252fscreenshots-update-posters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">查看更新日志</span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_47f2d72852b745b480548a428a67665f~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1903\" height=\"98\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fabulously-optimized\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabulously Optimized</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/variants-cit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Variants CIT</a> 是现代版本推荐的使用方案，替代 OptiFine。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpowerups4u.wixsite.com%252fseaofpixels%252ffabulously-optimized-settings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabulously Optimized 设置</a></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_47f2d72852b745b480548a428a67665f~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1903\" height=\"98\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:36px\">下载：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=26.2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_44c8b6f44f1e4d95bf1c0546b121e6c0~mv2.png\" alt=\"26.2\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21.11\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_b71e8a2667ac44d1b9ce9b01674ac8ca~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.21.11\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=Beta 1.8.1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_afc0117542b2428391b3e00297a09702~mv2.png\" alt=\"Bedrock (MCPE)\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_d5447066949f458c8a5a2dcb7526d5bf~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.20.6\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_95e6fdea52b745b480548a428a67665f~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.19.4\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.19.2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_50d6690501b540b089ef3a4b294229fa~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.19.2\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_7c4ac2c2175e4597b0dddbd71cb3d937~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.18.2\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_f386f8e1faf64e1095c77ce0d6183121~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.17.1\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.16.5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_ed1279479b604278b14f73d711866f91~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.16.5\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.15.2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_171624536c304714bc6f21515d26a122~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.15.2\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.12.2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_df370dd881c9465dbb5214199c28d013~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.12.2\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.11.2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_a50716e1ec374565ac5ae8dcedcd3965~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.11.2\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.10.2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_7dfac7435e5d4d7b8e99c47f31417373~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.10.2\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.9.4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_2430ea4eb37544eeb766cfeeda9a8562~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.9.4\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.8.9\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_9dceac023d5741a7adaaae1c3cf6270f~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.8.9\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.7.10\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_83e02fb7f9b4431280155bb18726f31b~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.7.10\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.6.4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_f72a10b3dca341cc9ecfa05869c10258~mv2.png\" alt=\"1.6.4\" width=\"190\" height=\"190\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_47f2d72852b745b480548a428a67665f~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1903\" height=\"98\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px;color:#000\">&nbsp;加入 New Default+ Discord 服务器：&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://discord.gg/xgH7rJT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">New Default+ Discord</a></span>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_309dbeb06ec34293aac65fd771aaefd7~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_660,h_660,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01/Discord-New-Logo.webp\" width=\"42\" height=\"48\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">&nbsp;查看 New Default+ Wiki： </span></span><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpowerups4u.wixsite.com%252fseaofpixels%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">New Default+ Wiki</a>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_7e885c86162e4b979b9214257b9d404b~mv2.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">通过成为 Patron 来支持 New Default+：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/new_default_plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">New Default+ Patreon</a></span>&nbsp;</span><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_4bbd073cbd6c4464b94633dbff3e84ee~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_275,h_275,al_c,lg_1,q_85,enc_auto/patreon-logo.png\" width=\"42\" height=\"48\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_ab455951e8b24116b88fb44e341beeac~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider\" width=\"1519\" height=\"304\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">功能截图：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_47f2d72852b745b480548a428a67665f~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1903\" height=\"98\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">重命名你的剑以更改其纹理！</span><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:36px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><br></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_82ef22f1a0c34f9ab2285decc2f898b4~mv2.png\" alt=\"1\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1070\"></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:14px\">仅在 1.21.5 之前的版本中需要 OptiFine 或 Fabulously Optimized！</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在 New Default+ Wiki 上查看所有铁砝物品名称：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpowerups4u.wixsite.com%252fseaofpixels%252fanvil-item-names-swords\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">New Default+ Wiki (铁砧剑)</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:14px\">包含来自 <span style=\"color:#f60\">Minecraft: Dungeons</span> 和 <span style=\"color:#f0f\">Minecraft: Story Mode</span> 的剑。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此功能在 Bedrock (MCPE) 材质包中<span style=\"color:#f00\">不可用</span>！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_47f2d72852b745b480548a428a67665f~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1903\" height=\"98\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">生物群系依赖的方块和特性！</span></p>\n<p><em><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_bd743bce83cb4c7085e1866f4690cf3c~mv2.png\" alt=\"7\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1071\"></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">需要 OptiFine 或 Fabulously Optimized！</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">此功能在 Bedrock (MCPE) 材质包中<span style=\"color:#f00\">不可用</span>！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_47f2d72852b745b480548a428a67665f~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1903\" height=\"98\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">重命名你的工具以更改其纹理！</span></p>\n<p><em><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_9069ba1fbcce4390a97020e53d4bdb99~mv2.png\" alt=\"2\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1071\"></em></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">仅在 1.21.5 之前的版本中需要 OptiFine 或 Fabulously Optimized！</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在 New Default+ Wiki 上查看所有铁砝物品名称：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpowerups4u.wixsite.com%252fseaofpixels%252fanvil-item-names\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">New Default+ Wiki (铁砧)</a></span><em><br></em></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">包含来自 <span style=\"color:#f90\">Minecraft: Dungeons</span> 和 <span style=\"color:#f0f\">Minecraft: Story Mode</span> 的工具。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此功能在基岩版 (MCPE) 包中<strong>不</strong>可用！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_47f2d72852b745b480548a428a67665f~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1903\" height=\"98\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">主世界像素艺术天空：</span></p>\n<p><em><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_e1f88264bd9743c595b0e5f1ae31abf6~mv2.png\" alt=\"8\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1071\"></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">需要 OptiFine 或 Fabulously Optimized！</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">此功能在基岩版 (MCPE) 包中<strong>不</strong>可用！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_47f2d72852b745b480548a428a67665f~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1903\" height=\"98\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">重命名你的护甲以更改其纹理！</span></p>\n<p><em><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_90491b4c71544695b47dcb8f9bfaa603~mv2.png\" alt=\"3\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1071\"></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">需要 OptiFine 或 Fabulously Optimized！使用 Fabulously Optimized 1.21.5 或更高版本时，还需要 Variants CIT！</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">在 New Default+ Wiki 上查看所有铁砧物品名称：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpowerups4u.wixsite.com%252fseaofpixels%252fanvil-item-names-armor-sets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">New Default+ Wiki (铁砧护甲套装)</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">包含来自 <span style=\"color:#f60\">Minecraft: Dungeons</span> 和 <span style=\"color:#f0f\">Minecraft: Story Mode</span> 的护甲套装。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">此功能在基岩版 (MCPE) 包中<strong>不</strong>可用！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_47f2d72852b745b480548a428a67665f~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1903\" height=\"98\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">像素艺术末地天空与紫颂末石！</span></p>\n<p><em><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_50b374fc45504efeb22ec897cbd7beb1~mv2.png\" alt=\"19\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1071\"></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">需要 OptiFine 或 Fabulously Optimized！</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">此功能在基岩版 (MCPE) 包中<strong>不</strong>可用！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_47f2d72852b745b480548a428a67665f~mv2.png\" alt